This repository contains two independent drivers, licensed separately because each is a port of a differently licensed vendor source.

  PeakUSB/     GPL-2.0-or-later
               Full text: PeakUSB/LICENSE
               Ported from PEAK's peak-linux-driver, which is GPL.

  KvaserUSB/   BSD-3-Clause OR GPL-2.0-only
               Full text: KvaserUSB/LICENSE
               Ported from Kvaser's linuxcan, which is dual licensed. You may
               use KvaserUSB under either licence, at your option.

Neither library is a derivative of the other, and neither is combined with the
other at build or link time. They are distributed together only for
convenience. Every source file carries an SPDX-License-Identifier naming the
licence that governs it, which is authoritative if this summary and a file
header ever disagree.

The build files at the top of the repository (Makefile) are GPL-2.0-or-later.

PEAK, PCAN and Kvaser, and the associated product names, are trademarks of
their respective owners. This project is not affiliated with, nor endorsed by,
PEAK-System Technik GmbH or Kvaser AB.
